        "id": "spec",
        "text": "A makes six small dolphins with fine yarn F and 4 mm hooks. B makes four large dolphins with thick yarn T and 6 mm hooks. Both are the same pattern; larger print means larger lettering, not a larger hook. Each learner needs one hook for the class. Two verified 4 mm spare hooks belong to the host and may replace uncertain tools without asking anyone.",
